              <p>Suva Business Center<br />177&ndash;181 Victoria Parade<br />Suva, Fiji</p>
              <p class="site-footer__office-contact"><a href="mailto:fiji@iconagency.com.au">fiji@iconagency.com.au</a></p>
            </address>
          </details>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="site-footer__base">
    <ul class="site-footer__social" role="list">
      <li><a class="site-footer__social-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/iconagency" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a class="site-footer__social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/iconagency" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="site-footer__ack">ICON recognises the First Peoples of this nation and their ongoing connection to culture and country. We acknowledge First Nations Peoples as the Traditional Owners, Custodians and Lore Keepers of the world&rsquo;s oldest living culture and pay respects to their Elders past, present and emerging.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- The brand lockup closes every page: the ICON logo at full width, with
       the hero's banner films playing inside it (see site-footer.css — the
       mark is a mask over a fill layer, so its contents are swappable).
       One clean string for assistive tech; the mark itself is decorative.

       preload="none" is deliberate: these are the hero's files, so on the
       homepage they are already cached, but on every other template they
       would be a multi-megabyte download for a footer decoration. Nothing
       is fetched until js/site-footer.js starts playback, which it only
       does once the panel is on screen. -->
  <p class="site-footer__lockup">
    <span class="sr-only">ICON</span>
    <span class="site-footer__lockup-line" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="site-footer__logo">
        <video class="site-footer__slide is-current" src="{{ theme_path }}/assets/banner/NWMPHN.mp4" muted playsinline loop preload="none"></video>
        <video class="site-footer__slide" src="{{ theme_path }}/assets/banner/banner-vid-nike-mara.mp4" muted playsinline loop preload="none"></video>
      </span>
    </span>
  </p>
</footer>
